GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "On Sundays, a lady comes to check\n"
	.string "out POKéMON.\p"
	.string "She even gives away TMs!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Hiker::
	.string "You can’t rename a POKéMON you get\n"
	.string "in a trade.\p"
	.string "The name is a reflection of the\n"
	.string "original trainer’s feelings for it.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman1::
	.string "MYSTERY GIFT.\p"
	.string "With just a little beep, you\n"
	.string "get a gift.\p"
	.string "If you want to get Mystery Gift\n"
	.string "you need to input these words at\l"
	.string "the sheet of paper on the counter:\p"
	.string "LINK TOGETHER WITH ALL.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "Hello. Oh, your POKéMON...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "It’s adorable!\p"
	.string "You should teach it good TM moves.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman2_3::
	.string "There are sure to be TMs that are\n"
	.string "just perfect for your POKéMON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman2_4::
	.string "It looks evil. How about this TM for\n"
	.string "it?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Woman2_5::
	.string "It’s very attached to you.\p"
	.string "This move should be perfect for a\n"
	.string "pair like you.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior12_Text_Sign::
	.string "Customize Your POKéMON\n"
	.string "5F TM CORNER$"
